 "personaname": "Thristam", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197991129630/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 7014, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2464, "last_played": 1709183909, "avatar": "a2b7961f8c739bc43d9f4787b5c765c67c3af508"}, "language": "english", "review": "Everything that l4d was, but better.", "timestamp_created": 1665852598, "timestamp_updated": 1665852598, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.447187364101409912", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "123876006", "author": {"steamid": "76561199208579517", "personaname": "FreeUnhealthCare", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199208579517/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 6505, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3732, "last_played": 1690433534, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "english", "review": "it good", "timestamp_created": 1665850076, "timestamp_updated": 1665850076, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.491111099720001221", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "123861248", "author": {"steamid": "76561197983177039", "personaname": "Cor", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197983177039/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 3038, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2619, "last_played": 1705969818, "avatar": "3f47c3634c822270cbccf23f4cb4fcf2272e23d1"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game just feels bad and frustrating to play.\n\nLag\nThe lag is the worst part; public servers, private servers, doesn't matter. Lag is so bad that zombies often  teleport toward you, and they have delayed hit reactions when you shoot them. The only way for the game to feel good is to play offline.\n\nQuickplay\nI built a sweet melee deck and wanted to try it, I que up in quick play because they give you a small bonus if you do, kept joining matches in progress where the group was nearly dead, can't pick my melee deck, have to take over a bot, we die before the safe room. \nThis happened 3 times.  \nOK i'll just start my own run and let people join me. I finished 2 levels and no one ever joined.\n\nGameplay\nInstantly become incapacitated by spitting special zombies ,or tanky tall bois that just run up and grab you, or wall babies that are just there to slow down your run and make sure you can''t sprint through the level, even if that's how you set up your deck. \n\nBad map design that leads you to fall off camouflaged ledges or jump into shallow looking water unless you've played the map several times before and already know where those pitfalls are, it feels like artificial or buggy difficulty as opposed to intended design. \n\nScreamers can be taken out before calling a horde, but sometimes the game changes the rules and so some screamers are part of an objective and will always call a horde no matter what. This is unexplained unless you've played before and paid attention. \n\nConclusion\nI just feel let down or like I'm not having fun after playing this game, even when we complete a map. \nHard to believe Turtle Rock helped to make Left 4 Dead because they've missed the mark on Back 4 Blood.", "timestamp_created": 1665830106, "timestamp_updated": 1665830262, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.530906319618225098", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}